@title Place rules: door and other surfaces as cards (1920x1080)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# The Rules panel ends with the surface rules of this cabinet in words: pilot devices go on the door by default.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-unplaced-plate.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
click_text "Rules"
wait 10
wait 10
scroll 1700 500 -1600
wait_s 1
shot surfaces-default
expect "Door and other surfaces"
expect "KoperCAD's default"
click_text "Add a surface rule"
wait 10
scroll 1700 500 -150
wait_s 1
shot surface-rule-added
expect "Back to KoperCAD's default"
expect "marked with letter Z"
expect "+ Add a surface rule"
click_text "Back to KoperCAD's default"
wait 10
shot back-to-default
